@startuml
actor "IoT Device" as Device
participant "Kafka Broker" as Kafka
participant "DeviceCollectorService" as DCS
participant "Schema Registry" as SR
participant "AvroDeserializer" as AVRO
participant "ShardingSphere JDBC" as SSJDBC
database "PostgreSQL Shard X" as DB
participant "Kafka Producer (DLT)" as DLT

title Обработка события об устройстве: success / failure с retry

== 1. Успешная обработка ==
Device -> Kafka : Публикует Avro(deviceId="abc")
Kafka -> DCS : Получает сообщение (batch или single)
activate DCS

DCS -> SR : GET /schemas/ids/{schema_id}
activate SR
SR --> DCS : JSON-схема
deactivate SR

DCS -> AVRO : Десериализовать байты → Device DTO
activate AVRO
AVRO --> DCS : com.nashkod.avro.Device
deactivate AVRO

DCS -> SSJDBC : saveOrUpdate(Device)
activate SSJDBC
SSJDBC -> DB : INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (device_id) DO UPDATE
activate DB
DB --> SSJDBC : OK
deactivate DB
SSJDBC --> DCS : Успех
deactivate SSJDBC

DCS -> DCS : incrementSuccess(shard=X), log INFO
DCS -> Kafka : commit offset
deactivate DCS

== 2. Ошибка → Retry → DLT ==
Device -> Kafka : Публикует Avro(deviceId="xyz")
Kafka -> DCS : Получает сообщение
activate DCS

DCS -> SR : GET схемы
SR --> DCS : OK
DCS -> AVRO : Десериализация
AVRO --> DCS : Device DTO

loop retry (max 3, backoff: 1s/2s/5s)
  DCS -> SSJDBC : saveOrUpdate(Device)
  activate SSJDBC
  SSJDBC -> DB : INSERT ...
  DB --> SSJDBC : Ошибка (например, connection refused)
  deactivate SSJDBC
  DCS -> DCS : Ждёт (backoff)
end

DCS -> DLT : Публикует в device-dlt-topic\n{payload, error, shard=X}
activate DLT
DLT --> DCS : Подтверждение
deactivate DLT

DCS -> DCS : incrementError(shard=X), log ERROR
DCS -> Kafka : commit offset (пропуск сообщения)
deactivate DCS

@enduml